                "textoPremium2": "Texts in Markdown format",
                "textoPremium3": "Type in Markdown format, advanced stylizing in the profile description, your comments and in your published games",
                "textoPremium4": "Better benefits",
                "textoPremium5": "Level up the file uploading size limit when publishing games, and so on with exclusive customization features. It also increases weight limit for our save data on games and you can have up to 20 additions in your games",
