                "textoPremium7": "You will be able to configurate achievements, customized pages and stablish a price for your games",
                "textoPremium8": "And more!",
                "textoPremium9": "Priority technicla support, higher priority reports, better luck when appearing on recommendations, and an official badge and access to new features",
                "textoPremium10": "One month",
                "textoPremium11": "6 months",
                "textoPremium12": "One year",
                "textoPremium13": "All the mentioned advantages are always included on MAGNA at any plan",
                "textoPremium14": "If you already had a MAGNA account, the expiration date will be postponed the amount of months you buy, if you didn't you will get MAGNA privileges for that many months. The prices of each months package may vary depending on time and region",
                "textoLegal1": "Terms & conditions apply",
                "tipBuscador": "Tip: search a tag or a genre to filter games"
            },
